BT /F2 15.00 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 780.00 Td (1. Getting started) Tj ET
BT /F3 10.20 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 756.00 Td (Sign in, find your way around and understand how the club data is organised.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.60 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 734.00 Td (MRHS ICT CLUB MASTER is a single-page application. Everything you see - members, attendance,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.60 Tf 0 0 0 rg 72.00 719.50 Td (courses, money - is stored in this browser on this device. There is no server to log into,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.60 Tf 0 0 0 rg 72.00 705.00 Td (so the app works offline and loads instantly once it has opened once.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11.00 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 682.50 Td (How to use it) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.80 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 664.50 Td (1.  Open the app. The boot screen loads the club data \(a first run seeds the full demo) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.80 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 650.00 Td (    dataset and takes a few seconds\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.80 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 635.50 Td (2.  On the login screen enter your username or email and password, then click Sign in.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.80 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 621.00 Td (    Tick Remember me on a private device so you stay signed in.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.80 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 606.50 Td (3.  Forgot a password? Click Forgot password? to see who to contact \(the club) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.80 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 592.00 Td (    administrator\) - passwords are stored as hashes and cannot be read back.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.80 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 577.50 Td (4.  The first demo sign-in button below the form fills the credentials for you; every demo) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.80 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 563.00 Td (    account uses the password demo1234.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.80 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 548.50 Td (5.  After signing in you land on the Dashboard. The left sidebar lists every module you) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.80 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 534.00 Td (    are allowed to open; the top bar holds global search, the theme switch, notifications) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.80 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 519.50 Td (    and your account menu.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.80 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 505.00 Td (6.  Press Ctrl+K \(or ?+K on a Mac\) at any time to search the whole database.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11.00 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 484.50 Td (Notes) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.40 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 466.50 Td (- The sidebar collapses into a drawer on phones and tablets - tap the menu icon in the top) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.40 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 452.00 Td (  bar.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.40 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 437.50 Td (- Every module page starts with headline numbers, then filters, then the record table.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.40 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 423.00 Td (  Detail pages open when you click a record name.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.40 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 408.50 Td (- Dark mode, light mode or follow the operating system: top-bar moon icon, or Settings ->) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.40 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 394.00 Td (  Appearance.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.40 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 379.50 Td (- The footer shows the club name, the academic year and how many records are stored in) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.40 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 365.00 Td (  total.) Tj ET
endstream
