0.85 0.85 0.85 RG 0.8 w 62.00 54.00 m 533.00 54.00 l S
BT /F2 15.00 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 780.00 Td (2. Roles and permissions) Tj ET
BT /F3 10.20 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 756.00 Td (Who can see and change what.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.60 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 734.00 Td (Permissions are attached to roles, not to people. When you change somebody's role in) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.60 Tf 0 0 0 rg 72.00 719.50 Td (Settings -> Users & roles, their menu, pages and buttons change immediately. If a page is) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.60 Tf 0 0 0 rg 72.00 705.00 Td (off-limits the app shows an "Access restricted" message instead of the data.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11.00 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 682.50 Td (Notes) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.40 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 664.50 Td (- Permission levels are view \(read only\), manage \(create and edit\) and full \(manage +) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.40 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 650.00 Td (  delete\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.40 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 635.50 Td (- Buttons you cannot use are hidden rather than disabled, so the interface stays clean.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.40 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 621.00 Td (  Restricted pages show a clear explanation instead of an error.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.40 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 606.50 Td (- Only Administrators can open this manual and the Settings module.) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
