BT /F1 9.80 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 687.00 Td (2.  Scan the ten KPI cards: total members, active members, cabinet members, active) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.80 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 672.50 Td (    courses, active projects, upcoming meetings, upcoming activities, attendance rate,) Tj ET
