BT /F1 9.80 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 643.50 Td (3.  Use the charts to follow attendance and membership over the last months; hover a bar) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.80 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 629.00 Td (    or point for exact figures.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.80 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 614.50 Td (4.  Check Upcoming events for the next meetings, activities and deadlines, and Active) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.80 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 600.00 Td (    projects for progress bars.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.80 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 585.50 Td (5.  Catch up with Recent activity and the announcements panel \(urgent and pinned notices) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.80 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 571.00 Td (    are featured first\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.80 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 556.50 Td (6.  Jump straight into work with the quick actions: Add member, Create meeting, Record) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.80 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 542.00 Td (    attendance, Add project, Create activity, Create report, Issue certificate, Add) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.80 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 527.50 Td (    course.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11.00 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 507.00 Td (Notes) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.40 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 489.00 Td (- The dashboard is personalised: a signed-in member sees their own attendance, courses and) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.40 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 474.50 Td (  certificates instead of club-wide totals.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.40 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 460.00 Td (- Anything you change elsewhere in the app updates these numbers the moment you save.) Tj ET
