BT /F2 15.00 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 780.00 Td (4. Members) Tj ET
BT /F3 10.20 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 756.00 Td (The register of every club member, with linked courses, projects and certificates.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11.00 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 734.00 Td (How to use it) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.80 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 716.00 Td (1.  Open Members to see the full register. Use the search box for a name, member ID, class) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.80 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 701.50 Td (    or skill.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.80 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 687.00 Td (2.  Filter by membership status, class or club role, and sort any column by clicking its) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.80 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 672.50 Td (    header.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.80 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 658.00 Td (3.  Click Add member to register somebody: name, gender, class, stream, student number,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.80 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 643.50 Td (    contact, email, join date, status, club role, skills, interests and notes. Required) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.80 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 629.00 Td (    fields are marked and validated.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.80 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 614.50 Td (4.  Open a member to see the profile page: attendance rate, courses with progress,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.80 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 600.00 Td (    projects, certificates, achievements and discipline notes, all pulled from the other) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.80 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 585.50 Td (    modules.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.80 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 571.00 Td (5.  From the profile use Print profile for the full A4 record or ID card for the credit-) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.80 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 556.50 Td (    card sized membership card.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.80 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 542.00 Td (6.  Use the row menu to edit, duplicate or delete a record, and Export to download the) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.80 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 527.50 Td (    register as CSV for Excel.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.80 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 513.00 Td (7.  Click Create member cards to print club ID cards for the members currently listed -) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.80 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 498.50 Td (    see the card section of this manual for sizes and printing tips.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11.00 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 478.00 Td (Notes) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.40 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 460.00 Td (- Member IDs are generated automatically in the form MRHS-ICT-M001 and stay unique.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.40 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 445.50 Td (- Deleting a member asks for confirmation and can be undone from the toast; linked records) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.40 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 431.00 Td (  stay behind for auditing.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.40 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 416.50 Td (- Add photos by selecting a file - images are stored in the browser's IndexedDB, not in) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.40 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 402.00 Td (  LocalStorage, so the register stays fast.) Tj ET
