BT /F3 10.20 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 756.00 Td (The thirteen club positions, their holders, terms of office and history.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11.00 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 734.00 Td (How to use it) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.80 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 716.00 Td (1.  Open Cabinet for the leadership directory, grouped into patron, executive committee) Tj ET
