BT /F1 9.80 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 687.00 Td (2.  Switch to the Organisational chart tab for the hierarchy view, or Cabinet history for) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.80 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 672.50 Td (    previous holders.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.80 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 658.00 Td (3.  Click Appoint a leader, choose the position, then pick a registered member \(their) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.80 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 643.50 Td (    name, contact and email fill in automatically\) or type an external appointment such as) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.80 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 629.00 Td (    the patron.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.80 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 614.50 Td (4.  Record the responsibilities and the term of office - these appear on the printed) Tj ET
