BT /F1 9.40 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 503.50 Td (- The app blocks two holders for the same position: it will offer to edit the existing) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.40 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 489.00 Td (  record instead.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.40 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 474.50 Td (- Appointing a member also updates that member's club role on their profile.) Tj ET
