BT /F3 10.20 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 756.00 Td (Schedule meetings, take minutes, record decisions and turn them into tasks.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11.00 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 734.00 Td (How to use it) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.80 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 716.00 Td (1.  Click Schedule meeting: title, type \(General, Cabinet, Training, Project, Emergency,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.80 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 701.50 Td (    Planning\), date, time, venue, chairperson, secretary and status.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.80 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 687.00 Td (2.  Open the meeting to build the agenda as a numbered list, then invite attendees -) Tj ET
