BT /F1 9.80 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 643.50 Td (    action items. Save as you go; the minutes can be printed on club letterhead.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.80 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 629.00 Td (4.  Action items become real club tasks: each one gets an owner and a deadline, and) Tj ET
