BT /F2 15.00 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 780.00 Td (7. Attendance) Tj ET
BT /F3 10.20 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 756.00 Td (One recorder for meetings, courses, activities, training and events.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11.00 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 734.00 Td (How to use it) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.80 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 716.00 Td (1.  Open Attendance and click Record attendance.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.80 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 701.50 Td (2.  Choose the session type \(meeting, course, activity, training or event\), then the) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.80 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 687.00 Td (    specific session and the date.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.80 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 672.50 Td (3.  Mark each member Present, Absent, Late or Excused - or use All present / All absent) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.80 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 658.00 Td (    and adjust the exceptions. Remarks can be added per member.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.80 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 643.50 Td (4.  Click Save attendance. If the session was already recorded the app updates those) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.80 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 629.00 Td (    records instead of duplicating them, and tells you so before saving.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.80 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 614.50 Td (5.  Read the dashboards: attendance rate, best and weakest sessions, monthly trend and) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.80 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 600.00 Td (    members below the low-attendance threshold.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.80 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 585.50 Td (6.  Open a member's history from the member profile, or run a monthly, termly or) Tj ET
