0.85 0.85 0.85 RG 0.8 w 62.00 54.00 m 533.00 54.00 l S
BT /F1 9.40 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 780.00 Td (  docs/CLOUD-STORAGE.md in the project folder: the short answer is a shared school Google) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.40 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 765.50 Td (  Drive folder with dated JSON backups every week, plus a USB copy and a printed termly) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.40 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 751.00 Td (  report.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.40 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 736.50 Td (- The platform can also put the backup into Microsoft OneDrive for you: Settings -> Data) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.40 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 722.00 Td (  -> Cloud backup. Route one writes each backup into a folder you pick once - the OneDrive) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.40 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 707.50 Td (  \(or Drive\) folder on the PC - and the sync client uploads it. Route two signs in to the) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.40 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 693.00 Td (  school's Microsoft 365 account and uploads straight into the app's own OneDrive folder;) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.40 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 678.50 Td (  it needs a one-time app registration \(choose How to set it up in the same card, or read) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.40 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 664.00 Td (  docs/ONEDRIVE.md\). Whichever route you use, Restore from OneDrive / folder lists the) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.40 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 649.50 Td (  backups and loads one back, in merge or replace mode.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.40 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 635.00 Td (- Backups never contain sign-in tokens, and the OneDrive connection only ever sees the app) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.40 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 620.50 Td (  folder Apps/MRHS ICT Club Master - never the rest of the school's drive.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.40 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 606.00 Td (- Firebase shared database. When several officers must work on the same live records -) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.40 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 591.50 Td (  attendance on one phone, finance on the desktop - connect the club's own Firebase) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.40 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 577.00 Td (  project in the same card: the club's Project ID and Web API key are already filled in) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.40 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 562.50 Td (  \(overwrite them only if the club moves to a different Firebase project\), so press Save) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.40 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 548.00 Td (  connection details, then Connect Firebase and sign in with the club's Firebase account.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.40 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 533.50 Td (  Sync now exchanges records; the switch Keep this device in sync automatically uploads) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.40 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 519.00 Td (  every change by itself and collects what the other officers changed within a few) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.40 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 504.50 Td (  minutes; Upload everything is for after a restore. Twenty-two collections are shared,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.40 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 490.00 Td (  while users \(officer accounts\), auditLog, verifications and notifications never leave) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.40 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 475.50 Td (  the device.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.40 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 461.00 Td (- Deletions are final. A record deleted here is marked as deleted immediately, so loading) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.40 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 446.50 Td (  from the shared database never brings it back; the deletion uploads on the next sync. A) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.40 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 432.00 Td (  record deleted by another officer is removed on this device too, unless it was edited) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.40 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 417.50 Td (  here after that - in which case the edit is kept and uploaded.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.40 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 403.00 Td (- The app keeps working with no internet: edits are saved here first and uploaded when the) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.40 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 388.50 Td (  connection returns. Where two officers changed the same record, the later edit \(compared) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.40 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 374.00 Td (  by its updatedAt time\) wins, and a local edit newer than the shared copy is never thrown) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.40 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 359.50 Td (  away - it is uploaded on the next sync. Setup takes about twenty minutes once \(create) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.40 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 345.00 Td (  the project, create the Firestore database, enable Email/Password, paste the security) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.40 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 330.50 Td (  rules\); the step-by-step guide is in docs/FIREBASE.md and behind How to set it up in the) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.40 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 316.00 Td (  app. Other options - Supabase, PocketBase, Turso, a Sheets mirror - are compared in) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.40 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 301.50 Td (  docs/DATABASE-OPTIONS.md.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.40 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 287.00 Td (- Restore in merge mode to add a backup's records to what is already there; replace mode) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.40 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 272.50 Td (  wipes first - the app asks for confirmation and shows how many records each option will) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.40 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 258.00 Td (  affect.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.40 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 243.50 Td (- A user who forgets their password cannot recover it; an administrator resets it here and) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.40 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 229.00 Td (  tells them the new one.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.40 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 214.50 Td (- Deactivating a user immediately ends their access without deleting the audit trail of) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.40 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 200.00 Td (  what they did.) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
