BT /F2 11.00 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 734.00 Td (How to use it) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.80 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 716.00 Td (1.  Press Ctrl+K, press /, or click the search box in the top bar to open global search.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.80 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 701.50 Td (2.  Type any name, ID, title or keyword. Results are grouped by type - members, cabinet,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.80 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 687.00 Td (    meetings, courses, projects, activities, certificates, resources, documents - and open) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.80 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 672.50 Td (    the record when you click or press Enter.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.80 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 658.00 Td (3.  Use the category chips inside the search overlay to narrow the results.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.80 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 643.50 Td (4.  Open the bell icon for the notification centre: upcoming meetings and activities,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.80 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 629.00 Td (    overdue tasks, course and project deadlines, new announcements, low attendance and) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.80 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 614.50 Td (    report deadlines.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.80 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 600.00 Td (5.  Mark notifications as read individually or all at once; the badge clears when the list) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.80 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 585.50 Td (    is empty.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.80 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 571.00 Td (6.  Click your avatar in the top bar for your profile, settings, certificate verification) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.80 Tf 0 0 0 rg 62.00 556.50 Td (    and sign-out.) Tj ET
